<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Emote Control — Setup</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container" style="max-width:580px">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="logo">
        <div class="logo-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h1>Connect Your PC</h1>
        <p>Follow these simple steps — it only takes a minute!</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="download-step">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Click the big button below to download a file</h3>
          <p>A small file called <strong>EmoteControl.bat</strong> will be saved to your <strong>Downloads</strong> folder. This is safe — it connects your PC so we can help you remotely.</p>
          <a href="/dashboard/new-session" class="btn btn-primary download-btn" style="font-size:16px;padding:14px 24px;">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/>
            </svg>
            Download EmoteControl.bat
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="download-step">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Open your Downloads folder</h3>
          <p>You can find it by opening <strong>File Explorer</strong> (the yellow folder icon on your taskbar) and clicking <strong>"Downloads"</strong> on the left side.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="download-step">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Double-click the file to run it</h3>
          <p>Look for the file named <strong>EmoteControl.bat</strong> and double-click it. A black window will appear — <strong>this is normal!</strong></p>
          <p style="margin-top:8px">If Windows shows a blue warning that says <em>"Windows protected your PC"</em>, click <strong>"More info"</strong>, then click <strong>"Run anyway"</strong>. This is safe.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="download-step">
        <div class="step-number">4</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Keep the black window open</h3>
          <p>The black window needs to stay open for the remote connection to work. <strong>Do not close it.</strong> You can minimize it (click the <strong>—</strong> button in the top right corner) to get it out of the way.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 5 -->
      <div class="download-step">
        <div class="step-number">5</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>That's it! You're all set.</h3>
          <p>Your PC is now connected. The person helping you can see your session on their dashboard. If you need to reconnect later, just double-click the same file again — it will pick up right where you left off.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Important note -->
      <div class="info-box">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <strong>Need help?</strong> If something goes wrong or you see an error, try closing the black window and double-clicking the file again. If it still doesn't work, contact the person who sent you this link.
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-outline" style="width:100%;margin-top:24px">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Dashboard
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
